## Usage Flow

### 1. Queue a Task

```bash
# Via Telegram
/grunt Create a Flutter widget for mood history chart following breathing_exercise_widget.dart pattern

# Via CLI
python scripts/grunt_worker.py add "Create mood chart widget"
```

### 2. Start Worker

```bash
# One-time run
python scripts/grunt_worker.py run

# Daemon mode (continuous)
python scripts/grunt_worker.py daemon
```

### 3. Get Results

- Output saved to `.brain/artifacts/grunt/{task_id}.md`
- Telegram notification when complete
- Review and copy to project

